      "widgets_values": [
        "Setup: read docs/COMFYUI.md. The base and PTD filenames are examples for files you convert locally.\nUse the original, unpruned H3 base; PTD adapters do not match the pruned/turbo/PDD base models.\nFour/six-step selection comes from the checkpoint. Basic Guider uses no extra CFG. Keep PTD Sampler + PTD Sigmas connected to the same loaded MODEL.\nThis example uses 1344 x 768, 124 frames, 24 FPS. Leave keyframe inputs disconnected for text-to-video.\nValidated release scope: four-step text-to-video with audio. Six-step and image-conditioned generation remain experimental. See docs/COMFYUI.md for compatibility and limitations."
      ],
